{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/5341","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/w3c/csswg-drafts","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/5341/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/5341/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/5341/events","html_url":"https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/5341","id":662139141,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWU2NjIxMzkxNDE=","number":5341,"title":"[css-variables] Disallow animation-tainted substitutions in any non-animatable property","user":{"login":"andruud","id":77163,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3MTYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/77163?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andruud","html_url":"https://github.com/andruud","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andruud/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andruud/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andruud/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andruud/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andruud/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andruud/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andruud/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andruud/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andruud/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":381892279,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzODE4OTIyNzk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/w3c/csswg-drafts/labels/css-variables-1","name":"css-variables-1","color":"c5def5","default":false,"description":"Current Work","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":395785969,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzOTU3ODU5Njk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/w3c/csswg-drafts/labels/Closed%20Accepted%20by%20CSSWG%20Resolution","name":"Closed Accepted by CSSWG Resolution","color":"0e8a16","default":false,"description":"Changes backed by a CSSWG resolution.","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":395787944,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzOTU3ODc5NDQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/w3c/csswg-drafts/labels/Commenter%20Satisfied","name":"Commenter Satisfied","color":"00ff00","default":false,"description":"Commenter has indicated satisfaction with the resolution / edits.","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":665433501,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw2NjU0MzM1MDE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/w3c/csswg-drafts/labels/Needs%20Testcase%20(WPT)","name":"Needs Testcase (WPT)","color":"5319e7","default":false,"description":null,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2020-07-20T18:43:15Z","updated_at":"2021-07-28T20:30:38Z","closed_at":"2021-07-28T20:30:38Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Currently, if a custom property is animation-tainted, it's [not allowed to substitute](https://drafts.csswg.org/css-variables/#substitute-a-var) that custom property into `animation-` properties, nor the `display` property (with some conditions).\r\n\r\nThis means (since it's not mentioned), that it's allowed to substitute an animation-tainted custom property into `direction` and `writing-mode` (among others), effectively making those properties animatable. This makes it unnecessarily complicated to specify a reasonable behavior for css-logical properties in animation keyframes, since the physical properties involved change during the animation.\r\n\r\nProperties are probably 'not animatable' [for a reason](https://drafts.csswg.org/web-animations/#not-animatable), so it seems bad to create a loophole where unwanted complexity can \"escape\".\r\n\r\nI propose that we (unconditionally) disallow animation-tainted custom property substitutions in any property that's 'not animatable'.\r\n\r\nFor what it's worth, Chrome already has this behavior (possibly since the beginning), and I've seen no complaints.","closed_by":{"login":"tabatkins","id":682840,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4Mjg0MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/682840?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tabatkins","html_url":"https://github.com/tabatkins","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tabatkins/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tabatkins/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tabatkins/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tabatkins/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tabatkins/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tabatkins/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tabatkins/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tabatkins/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tabatkins/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/5341/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/5341/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}